---
layout: base.njk
title: Articles
permalink: /articles/
summary: Articles by Abhay Inamdar on pharmaceutical engineering, aseptic manufacturing, capital projects and plant performance.
---
<section class="wrap narrow page-head">
  <h1>Articles</h1>
  <p class="lead">Notes from 30+ years of building and running pharmaceutical plants: aseptic design, compliance, projects and plant performance.</p>
</section>
<section class="wrap narrow">
  <ul class="post-list">
    {% for post in collections.articles %}
    <li>
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
      <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
      <p>{{ post.data.summary }}</p>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
